# Deploy targets

## Default (always)

- **Develop and deploy only in Workspace** → production **Sheetomatic** (`sheetomatic.com` / `app.sheetomatic.com`).
- Commit, push `main`, and Vercel verify for Sheetomatic unless the user **explicitly** names another target.

## Named exceptions only

Deploy or push to **Hingorani**, **Tops**, or **Anmol** **only** when the user clearly says so, e.g.:

- "deploy on Hingorani"
- "deploy to Tops"
- "push Anmol portal"
- "deploy Anmol"

Do **not** infer those targets from context (legal cases, Anmol tasks, client names) unless they name the deploy target in that message.

## Do not

- Push Sheetomatic changes to Hingorani / Tops / Anmol repos or Vercel projects by default.
- Run release-ops for those portals without an explicit user request.

## When a named portal is requested

Follow `docs/CLIENT_PORTAL_ONBOARDING_SOP.md`. Do not deploy until
`node scripts/client-portal-preflight.mjs --project {slug} --slug {slug}` exits 0.

## When ambiguous

Ask: *"Deploy to Sheetomatic only, or to Hingorani / Tops / Anmol?"* — default answer is Sheetomatic.
